          "id": "MHWhouO72rbCG3vP",
          "name": "Whip Tail",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The mokele-mbembe cracks its tail, creating a sonic boom in a 5-foot burst centered on a corner within reach of its tail Strike.\nEach creature in the burst's area must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:28) save. Mokele-mbembes are immune.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature is Stunned 1.\nFailure The creature is Stunned 2.\nCritical Failure The creature is Stunned 3.",
