          "name": "Flameheart Weapon",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The peri can call forth a powerful weapon from their heart of flame. In their hands, this is a +2 Greater Flaming greater striking weapon that deals 2d6 fire damage instead of 1d6.",
