          "description": "Trigger A creature within 60 feet who the deathless acolyte can see and who doesn't worship Urgathoa casts a divine spell\nEffect The deathless acolyte attempts to counteract the triggering spell using their spell attack modifier and a counteract rank of 2. If the deathless acolyte fails to counteract the spell, the caster is temporarily immune to further uses of Denounce Heretic for 24 hours.",
