          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The daqqanoenyent's face twists into an expression of unbridled rage. Each creature within 30-foot emanation that can see the daqqanoenyent must attempt a check (will, dc:28) save. The creature is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature is Frightened 1.\nFailure The creature is Frightened 2.\nCritical Failure The creature is Frightened 3.",
