          "description": "30 feet. A cloud of choking, acrid dust swirls about the hollow serpent, draining moisture from any enemy within. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:34, options:area-effect,inflicts:enfeebled,inflicts:slowed) save or become Enfeebled 2 and Slowed 1 for 1d4 (2d4 on a critical failure). A creature that succeeds is temporarily immune for 24 hours.",
