          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The maliadi has resistance 20 to physical ranged attacks, such as arrows, bolts, javelins, and thrown rocks, as such attacks are magically diverted through its collar of fire.\nNonmagical weapons and ammunition affected by this ability are incinerated and destroyed.",
