          "name": "Counterspelling Wall",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature within 100 feet of the maliadi that the maliadi can see Casts a Spell that targets the maliadi\nEffect The maliadi casts one of its innate Wall of Fire spells, with a duration of 1 round.\nIf the spell that triggered this reaction passes through the wall of fire, the wall attempts to counteract it, with a counteract modifier of 1d20+28.",
