          "name": "Capsize",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The maliadi tries to capsize an adjacent aquatic vessel of its size or smaller.\nThe maliadi must succeed at a check (athletics, dc:35) check (reduced by 5 for each size smaller the vessel is than the maliadi) or the pilot's Sailing Lore DC, whichever is higher.",
