          "name": "River Form",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The maliadi takes on the form of a stretch of river, with the effects of Migration, except the maliadi can only affect itself, appears as a section of a flowing river that takes up the same space as the maliadi, and can't leave the ground.",
