          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The imperfect automaton utters a mournful cry in a 30-foot cone. The cry deals 4d6 mental damage to all creatures in the area (check (will, dc:22, options:area-effect,damaging-effect) save). The imperfect automaton can't use its Empty Wail again for 1d4.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature takes half damage.\nFailure The creature takes full damage and is Stupefied 1 for 1d4+1.\nCritical Failure The creature takes double damage and is stupefied 1 for 1d4+1 rounds and Stunned 1.",
