          "description": "20 feet. A thick swarm of mosquitoes surrounds the Mosquito Witch, creating concealment in the aura. A creature that begins its turn in the emanation becomes Sickened 1 unless it succeeds at a check (fortitude, dc:26) save. The Mosquito Witch and arthropods can see through this aura and are immune to its sickened effect.",
