          "id": "2vjvjlmw4lJ6Kx0X",
          "name": "Outsmart",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature attacks while the ratajin mastermind is Off-Guard\nEffect Due to planning, the ratajin mastermind can react quickly to poor situations. The ratajin mastermind isn't treated as off-guard to the attack, and the triggering creature is off-guard to the next attack made before the end of the ratajin mastermind's next turn.",
