          "name": "Long Fall",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature steps onto the cracked earth\nEffect The creature fractures the thin crust of earth and falls through. That creature can use the Grab an Edge reaction to avoid falling, as long as it is adjacent to an edge. Otherwise it takes falling damage (typically 25 bludgeoning damage for a 50-foot drop). Some of these rifts eventually lead to the Darklands.",
