          "name": "Nimble Dodge",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature targets Calmont with an attack and he can see the attacker.\nRequirements Calmont is not Encumbered\nCalmont deftly dodges out of the way, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.",
