          "name": "Thrown Weapon Mastery",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Any weapon a charau-ka dragon priest throws gains the deadly d6 weapon trait. Furthermore, when a dragon priest throws an improvised weapon, it does not take the -2 penalty for doing so, nor does it take a penalty for using a thrown improvised weapon with the nonlethal trait to make a lethal attack.",
