          "description": "Trigger A creature within reach of the spawn's tail uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using.\nEffect The spawn of Dahak makes a tail Strike at the creature with a -2 penalty. If it hits, they disrupt the creature's action.",
          "traits": []
