          "name": "Whiplash",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature within 10 feet of Gerhard uses an action with the move trait to leave a square.\nEffect Gerhard attempts to Trip the triggering creature. On a success, the creature also takes damage as if Gerhard hit with his whip Strike, and if the creature was flying, it falls 30 feet.",
