          "id": "Xy8CYVbA7GcoN8SC",
          "name": "Whip Swing",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirement Gerhard is in a jungle, dense forest, or an area with numerous overhead beams.\nEffect Gerhard uses his whip to lash upward to wrap around an overhanging tree branch; he then swings up to 30 feet in a straight line, and must end the movement on solid ground or fall.",
