          "id": "Am5pbCNVDkDBNz5Y",
          "name": "Stench",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "10 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:26, options:area-effect,inflicts:sickened,inflicts:slowed) save or become Sickened 1 (plus Slowed 1 as long as it's sickened on a critical failure).\nWhile within the aura, the creature takes a -2 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute.\nEffect: Stench",
