          "name": "Rejuvenation",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "24 hours after King Harral is destroyed, his body rebuilds itself on his throne (or, if the throne is destroyed, on the site where the throne once sat), similarly to how a lich's body is restored via its phylactery. If all of Saggorak's buildings are destroyed, or if heroes perform a great service in saving Saggorak, King Harral loses this ability.",
